Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.MolBiolClinAssoc
Column name: MolClin Type: STRING Description: this flag indicates whether this row describes a molecular 'M' or clinical 'C' association
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: Morph Type: STRING Description: morphology code, eg '3111'
Column name: Topo Type: STRING Description: topography code, eg '0401'
Column name: Immunology Type: STRING Description: immunology flag, usually blank, other values are 'B' or 'T'
Column name: GeneLength Type: STRING Description: length of gene string -- usually an integer between 0 and 15
Column name: GeneShort Type: STRING Description: gene symbol(s), eg 'BCR/ABL1', or 'IGH+', etc
Column name: GeneLong Type: STRING Description: this field is always blank (never needed)
Column name: KaryLength Type: INT64 Description: length of karyotype description string (up to 569)
Column name: KaryShort Type: STRING Description: short or truncated karyotype string, eg 't(19;19)(p13;p13)' or '+12,+19'
Column name: KaryLong Type: STRING Description: blank or long karyotype description
